  STATE --> WD["Progress watchdog"]:::safety
  WD --> VERIFY["Reconciliation / contradiction guard"]:::safety
  VERIFY --> TRACE["Trace recorder<br/>route • node • tool • duration • status • receipt"]:::trace
  TRACE --> NEXT["Next route, review, or safe stop"]
  TOOLS --> APPROVAL["Approval guard on every side effect"]:::safety
